	.PSECT	$CODE,PIC,CON,REL,LCL,SHR,EXE,RD,NOWRT,LONG
;  222
;  223    ! WITHOUT_NOISE is X, or 0 if X is no larger than LEVEL: a point
;  224    ! computed as A + K*S, which should be 0, is a rounding error instead
;  225    ! (-0.3 + 3*0.1 is 5.6E-17), and would be shown as one.
;  226    real(rk) function without_noise(x, level)
